data: {"id": "1129ce34ecca4482-final", "run_id": "1129ce34ecca4482", "seq": 593, "ts_ms": 1788794628485, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` | CrashLoopBackOff | ConfigMap 'workload-code' 挂载路径下缺少应用启动所需的配置文件或 Key，导致应用进程启动时读取配置失败（退出码 78 / CONFIG_MISSING）并进入 CrashLoopBackOff。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 退出码 `78` (fact-145539073294) | 提供进程崩溃的直接退出码，指向配置/文件缺失类错误 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 状态 `CrashLoopBackOff` (fact-77af831cde0e) | 确认应用启动后立即崩溃并持续重启的现象 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... back-off 5m0s restarting failed container` (fact-56205adb62fd) | 确认kubelet因容器频繁退出执行指数退避重启策略 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，标签 `reason=\"CrashLoopBackOff\"` (fact-4a9a293daa64) | 从集群级别指标确认该 Pod 处于等待重启状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 `13` (fact-842203c4f866) | 量化重启次数，确认为非偶发故障 |\n| 6 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 错误模式 `CONFIG_MISSING`，路径 `/work` (fact-1dc34210d4bd 等 8 条记录) | 核心业务日志直接指明故障原因为配置缺失 (CONFIG_MISSING) |\n| 7 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | HTTP `GET /work` 返回 `500` 状态码，伴随 trace_id 匹配 (fact-691f9bdc116f, fact-207c4f051754) | 应用接口请求失败，与日志错误码对应，证明应用进程存活但无法处理请求 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 状态提供了故障现象（退出码 78 与 CrashLoopBackOff），Prometheus 指标证实了该异常的持续存在。日志中高频出现的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 模式精准匹配了退出码的含义，Trace 层面的 500 错误进一步印证了应用进程因配置问题导致请求处理失败。多维度证据形成闭环，指向明确的配置缺失原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap挂载路径下缺少配置文件或Key → 应用启动读取配置失败(退出码78/CONFIG_MISSING) → 容器进程崩溃 → Pod进入CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：应用 `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 的启动脚本或配置文件挂载点缺失。\n\n证据链如下：\n1. **现象确认**：Pod `app` 容器持续以退出码 `78` 崩溃，状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`（事实 1、2、3、4、5）。\n2. **原因定位**：应用内部日志高频报错 `CONFIG_MISSING`，且请求路径为 `/work`（事实 6）。\n3. **关联验证**：Trace 数据显示对 `/work` 的请求返回 500 错误，且 Trace ID 与日志关联（事实 7）。\n\n综合证据，根因是 `ConfigMap 'workload-code'` 中缺少应用启动或运行所需的配置文件或 Key，导致应用进程启动失败或启动后无法正常工作而崩溃退出。现有证据链完整，足以支撑此结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 59.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 59.7s (Evidence 50.6s, RCA 9.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 86.796, "metrics": {"run_id": "1129ce34ecca4482", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 86.8027675151825, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 86802.7675151825, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 63924.27206039429, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 29081.902027130127, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 22405.181884765625}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14952.29458808899, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 59734.48872566223, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12094.369649887085, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

